flowchart LR
  C["Client<br/>Obtain a token<br/>Call the protected API"]
  I["JWT Issuer<br/>Establish identity and roles<br/>Sign with the private key<br/>Supply public keys and contract"]
  R["JWT Resource Server<br/>Verify signature and claims<br/>Map roles to authorities<br/>Enforce endpoint policy"]
  C -->|Token request| I
  I -->|Signed JWT| C
  I -.->|Public key or JWKS| R
  C -->|Protected API request with bearer JWT| R
